+/* ---------- aurora background ----------
+   Three fixed layers, each holding two soft glows. Every layer moves on its
+   own slow loop (47s, 61s, 83s) and "breathes" on another (19s, 29s, 37s).
+   Because the loop lengths don't line up, the combined motion takes minutes
+   to repeat and looks random. Only transform + opacity are animated, so it
+   runs on the GPU and stays smooth.                                        */
